      "writtenOn": "2025-04-15T19:17:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I haven\u0027t seen the CL which uses these APIs, but what would happen if we didn\u0027t have this public function? Like what if the client just only called hasNewVkPipelineCacheData()? It seems like things should just work the same right?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 518,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 529,
        "endChar": 49
      },
      "revId": "7ccec5fae83fb2f7b94672d187113b63c2668514",
